{"seq":2,"slug":"ad-valorem-vs-specific-duty-calc","title":"关税计算引擎：从价税率、按件定额与邮政渠道过渡期计征","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/demiminimis-lowvalue-parcel-policy/declaration-duty-engine/ad-valorem-vs-specific-duty-calc","wordCount":2692,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"关税计算引擎-从价税率-按件定额与邮政渠道过渡期计征\">关税计算引擎：从价税率、按件定额与邮政渠道过渡期计征</h1><p>2025 年 8 月 29 日起，一件从深圳发往洛杉矶、申报 42 美元的邮政小包不再因为&quot;低于门槛&quot;而自动免税——它仍然走邮政渠道、仍然可能没有正式报关单，但美国海关（CBP）要求承运商在<strong>两种计征方法中二选一</strong>：要么按货值乘以原产国有效税率（从价），要么干脆按件收定额税。同一件商品，选前者得出 <code>42 × 某税率</code>，选后者可能直接是 80、160 或 200 美元。这不是一个&quot;填个税率&quot;的问题，而是<strong>计税引擎必须同时实现两套形态不同、取数链不同、精度语义不同的定额模型</strong>，并让它们在同一个运单上下文中可切换、可复算、可留证。这篇文档拆解这个引擎：从价税率怎么取、按件定额怎么定、邮政过渡期怎么建模，以及为什么&quot;两个都对&quot;才是正确性标准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从价-从量-混合与择大四种骨架\">核心概念：从价、从量、混合与择大四种骨架</h2><p>一切关税计算最终落到三种骨架之一。**从价税（ad valorem）**按完税价格的比例征收，公式是货值乘以税率；**从量税（specific）**按物理计量单位征收，与价格脱钩；**混合税（compound / mixed）**是两者的组合。用 <code>V</code> 表示完税价格、<code>r</code> 表示从价税率、<code>Q</code> 表示计量数量（件、千克、升）、<code>s</code> 表示单位从量税率，则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>duty</mtext><mtext>ad valorem</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>r</mi><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mtext>duty</mtext><mtext>specific</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>s</mi><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mtext>duty</mtext><mtext>compound</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{duty}_{\\text{ad valorem}} = V \\times r\n\\qquad\n\\text{duty}_{\\text{specific}} = Q \\times s\n\\qquad\n\\text{duty}_{\\text{compound}} = V \\times r + Q \\times s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">duty</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ad valorem</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0747em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">duty</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">specific</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0747em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">duty</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">compound</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>另一种常见混合形态是<strong>择大征收（alternative）</strong>，取两者中高者：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>duty</mtext><mtext>alternative</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>Q</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{duty}_{\\text{alternative}} = \\max(V \\times r,\\; Q \\times s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">duty</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">alternative</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>工程含义在于：从价与从量对<strong>数据依赖完全不同</strong>。从价依赖 <code>value</code> 字段的准确性与估价口径——若口径错（内在价值当 CIF 用），税额直接错，且错误是连续的、不可察觉的。从量依赖 <code>quantity</code> 与计量单位——单位为&quot;件&quot;还是&quot;打&quot;、是否含内包装，是另一个静默错误源。混合与择大则要求引擎在<strong>同一行明细</strong>上同时持有可用的 <code>V</code> 与 <code>Q</code>，缺一即无法计算。因此在数据模型里，<code>value</code>、<code>value_basis</code>、<code>quantity</code>、<code>uom</code>（计量单位）必须作为<strong>并列的必填维度</strong>存在，而非&quot;有一即可&quot;。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>骨架</th>\n<th>公式</th>\n<th>主数据依赖</th>\n<th>典型失误</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>从价</td>\n<td><code>V × r</code></td>\n<td>完税价格 + 税率</td>\n<td>估价口径错、汇率未锁定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>从量</td>\n<td><code>Q × s</code></td>\n<td>数量 + 单位 + 单位税率</td>\n<td>单位不一致、数量口径不同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合</td>\n<td><code>V×r + Q×s</code></td>\n<td>两者都需要</td>\n<td>缺一项即算不出，却被默认置零</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>择大</td>\n<td><code>max(V×r, Q×s)</code></td>\n<td>两者都需要</td>\n<td>取小、或对负数未取零</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中最容易埋雷的是&quot;缺项被默认置零&quot;：当某行缺 <code>quantity</code> 时，混合税会静默退化成从价税，少征却不报错。引擎应在缺失必填维度时<strong>拒绝计征并抛事件</strong>，而不是补零后放行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"美国邮政渠道过渡期-按件定额的三档与月度切换\">美国邮政渠道过渡期：按件定额的三档与月度切换</h2><p>低值包裹领域最尖锐的从量实践，来自美国 2025 年的政策转向。第 14324 号行政令（2025 年 7 月 30 日签署，Suspending Duty-Free De Minimis Treatment for All Countries）取消了 19 U.S.C. §1321(a)(2)(C) 下的免税待遇，&quot;不论货值、原产国、运输方式或入境方式&quot;；其实施自 <strong>2025 年 8 月 29 日 00:01 EDT</strong> 起对入境消费的货物生效。对<strong>国际邮政渠道</strong>，该行政令第 3 节给了两条并行路径，承运商必须择一执行，且<strong>每月最多切换一次、切换需提前 24 小时通知</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>第 3(b) 节 从价法</strong>：按包裹货值乘以该原产国的有效 IEEPA 关税率计征；</li>\n<li><strong>第 3(c) 节 按件定额法</strong>：依原产国有效 IEEPA 税率落入三档，对<strong>每件</strong>征收固定金额——税率<strong>低于 16%</strong> 收 <strong>80 美元</strong>；<strong>16% 至 25%（含）</strong> 收 <strong>160 美元</strong>；<strong>高于 25%</strong> 收 <strong>200 美元</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三档可写成以原产国有效税率为自变量的分段函数（税率以百分数便于对齐原文；<code>unit</code> 指每件）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>duty</mtext><mtext>flat</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mn>80</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>n</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mn>160</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>n</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mn>200</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>n</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{duty}_{\\text{flat}}(r\\%) =\n\\begin{cases}\n80 \\times n, &amp; r\\% &lt; 16 \\\\\n160 \\times n, &amp; 16 \\le r\\% \\le 25 \\\\\n200 \\times n, &amp; r\\% &gt; 25\n\\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">duty</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">flat</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord\">%</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.32em;vertical-align:-1.91em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.35em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.192em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.85em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">80</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">160</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord\">%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord\">%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord\">%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这里的 <code>n</code> 是<strong>件数</strong>，不是包裹数——行政令用的是 &quot;per item&quot;（按件），这与通常&quot;按包裹&quot;的直觉不同，是引擎里最容易误读的一处：同一个包裹装 3 件不同商品，定额法的税基件数就是 3。同时，从价法的 <code>r%</code> 取值是&quot;原产国有效 IEEPA 税率&quot;，它本身是<strong>逐国、逐期变动的政策量</strong>，必须由<a href=\"../policy-rule-model/effective-dated-policy-rule-engine\">有效期政策规则引擎</a>按发运日/入境日锁定，绝不能在计征时读一个&quot;当前值&quot;。</p>\n<p>过渡期的工程要点有三：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>定额法是有期限的。</strong> 该按件定额选项在行政令下<strong>六个月后到期</strong>，此后所有邮政货物须改用从价法。引擎必须把&quot;定额法可用窗口&quot;建成带生效区间的规则，而非写死的布尔开关——到窗口结束日，切换逻辑应自动失效并回落到从价。</li>\n<li><strong>方法选择状态挂在承运商上，而非运单上。</strong> 允许每月切换一次意味着同一承运商在同一计价周期内方法稳定；引擎需要一个 <code>carrier_method_election</code> 记录（承运商 × 生效月 × 方法），并对提前 24 小时的通知要求留出&quot;切换生效时间&quot;字段。</li>\n<li><strong>两种方法的税额可能相差数量级。</strong> 一件 42 美元的包裹在从价法下税基是 42 美元，在定额法下是 160 美元。这不是计算错误，而是政策有意为之的<strong>平价工具</strong>——它让&quot;低值&quot;不再自动等于&quot;低税&quot;。引擎必须如实输出所选方法的金额，并对两种方法<strong>各算一遍、都留证</strong>，以便事后解释&quot;为什么收了这么多&quot;。</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[运单进入计征] --&gt; B{渠道=国际邮政?}&#10;  B -- 否 --&gt; C[正式报关路径&lt;br/&gt;走从价/从量/混合]&#10;  B -- 是 --&gt; D{定额法窗口内&lt;br/&gt;且在效?}&#10;  D -- 否 --&gt; E[从价法&lt;br/&gt;V × 原产国有效税率]&#10;  D -- 是 --&gt; F{承运商本月选择了&lt;br/&gt;哪种方法?}&#10;  F -- 从价 --&gt; E&#10;  F -- 定额 --&gt; G{查原产国有效税率 r%}&#10;  G --&gt; H[r% &lt; 16 → 80 × 件数]&#10;  G --&gt; I[16 ≤ r% ≤ 25 → 160 × 件数]&#10;  G --&gt; J[r% &gt; 25 → 200 × 件数]&#10;  C --&gt; K[汇总税额 + 留证]&#10;  E --&gt; K&#10;  H --&gt; K&#10;  I --&gt; K&#10;  J --&gt; K\">flowchart TD\n  A[运单进入计征] --&gt; B{渠道=国际邮政?}\n  B -- 否 --&gt; C[正式报关路径&lt;br/&gt;走从价/从量/混合]\n  B -- 是 --&gt; D{定额法窗口内&lt;br/&gt;且在效?}\n  D -- 否 --&gt; E[从价法&lt;br/&gt;V × 原产国有效税率]\n  D -- 是 --&gt; F{承运商本月选择了&lt;br/&gt;哪种方法?}\n  F -- 从价 --&gt; E\n  F -- 定额 --&gt; G{查原产国有效税率 r%}\n  G --&gt; H[r% &lt; 16 → 80 × 件数]\n  G --&gt; I[16 ≤ r% ≤ 25 → 160 × 件数]\n  G --&gt; J[r% &gt; 25 → 200 × 件数]\n  C --&gt; K[汇总税额 + 留证]\n  E --&gt; K\n  H --&gt; K\n  I --&gt; K\n  J --&gt; K</pre><h2 id=\"从价税率的取数链-叠加-归并与汇率锁定\">从价税率的取数链：叠加、归并与汇率锁定</h2><p>从价法的正确性，几乎全部取决于税率 <code>r</code> 的取数链。对低值包裹，<code>r</code> 从不是一个单一数字，而是<strong>若干税率层的叠加结果</strong>：基础关税（依 HS 编码的商品税率）、贸易救济措施（反倾销/反补贴）、以及临时性附加税（如 IEEPA 项下的对等关税）。设 <code>r_base(hs)</code> 为按商品编码的基本税率、<code>Σr_i</code> 为各项附加/救济税率，则实际从价税率为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>effective</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>base</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>h</mi><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{effective}} = r_{\\text{base}}(hs) + \\sum_i r_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">effective</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">base</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>欧盟与美国在低值 VAT 侧的对照，正好说明&quot;税种决定口径&quot;：自 2021 年 7 月 1 日起，欧盟取消了低值进口包裹的<strong>增值税</strong>豁免，改为在销售环节征收，配套机制是 <strong>IOSS（Import One-Stop Shop）</strong>——适用于&quot;每笔 consignment 价值不超过 <strong>150 欧元</strong>、且面向非纳税义务人&quot;的进口，且货物须非欧盟仓储、非消费税应税品；非欧盟设立的纳税人须指定一名欧盟境内<strong>中介</strong>才能使用 IOSS，VAT 申报按月进行。（来源：欧盟委员会 VAT One Stop Shop 官方说明）注意其措辞是 VAT 侧的 consignment 与 150 欧元门槛，与关税侧的规则<strong>并不重合</strong>；引擎不能用一个阈值同时服务于两个税种。</p>\n<p>取数链上有三处必须显式锁定，否则结果不可复算：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>原产国 / 目的国维度</strong>：同一 HS 编码在不同原产国下适用不同关税待遇（原产地规则、自贸协定、附加税），<code>r</code> 是 <code>(hs, origin, destination, date)</code> 的函数，不是 <code>hs</code> 的函数。</li>\n<li><strong>汇率来源与定格时点</strong>：从价税基是外币时，须按<strong>某机构某日的可追溯牌价</strong>折算，并把 <code>fx_rate_ref</code> 落库。汇率取&quot;下单日&quot;还是&quot;入境日&quot;，会给出不同税额，规则必须声明。</li>\n<li><strong>规则生效日 vs 入境日</strong>：政策税率频繁变动，必须明示按哪个日期取值。美国邮政定额法用的是行政令下的&quot;入境/消费&quot;时点，这是一个明确的锚，引擎应以该锚定日选规则版本。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"引擎实现-精度-取整-币种与幂等\">引擎实现：精度、取整、币种与幂等</h2><p>把模型落到可运行代码，几个工程决策决定成败。<strong>第一，按最小货币单位整数运算。</strong> 税额与税基一律用整数分（或更小单位）计算，<code>rate</code> 用定点或高精度小数表示，避免浮点误差在&quot;汇总几千行&quot;时累积成可观的偏差。<strong>第二，取整规则集中且可配置。</strong> 从价税额 <code>V × r</code> 几乎总是产生小数，是四舍五入、进一（ceiling，海关常见）还是截断，必须是一个带版本号的策略，而非散落在各处的 <code>Math.round</code>。<strong>第三，币种与舍入的次序固定。</strong> 应&quot;先按原币计算、再折算、再按目的国货币取整&quot;，还是&quot;先折算再计算&quot;，两种次序结果不同，必须二者择一定死并写入测试。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>duty</mtext><mtext>final</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mtext>round</mtext><mtext>policy</mtext></msub><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mtext>fx</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>CIF</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>effective</mtext></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>duty</mtext><mtext>flat, if applicable</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{duty}_{\\text{final}} = \\text{round}_{\\text{policy}}\\!\\left( \\text{fx}(\\, V_{\\text{CIF}} \\times r_{\\text{effective}} \\,) + \\text{duty}_{\\text{flat, if applicable}} \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">duty</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">final</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2302em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">round</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">policy</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fx</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">CIF</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">effective</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">duty</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">flat, if applicable</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>第四，幂等与可重算。</strong> 同一运单在同一规则版本下重算必须得到相同结果——这要求计征函数的输入是<strong>完整的、冻结的</strong>（货值、口径、HS、原产国、规则版本、汇率引用、方法选择），而不能在重算时读取会漂移的&quot;当前配置&quot;。<strong>第五，每次计征输出证据。</strong> 命中的规则 ID、<code>r_effective</code> 的构成明细、所用汇率与日期、所选方法、以及&quot;若切换另一方法会是多少&quot;，都应随税额一并落库。当监管或客户质疑&quot;凭什么收这么多&quot;时，能复现每一步取数，才是这套引擎真正交付的东西。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>从价、从量、混合、择大这四种骨架，加上海关的估价口径与汇率锁定，构成关税计算引擎的通用底座；而低值包裹场景额外叠了一层<strong>渠道分化</strong>——美国 2025 年的邮政过渡期把&quot;按件定额&quot;（80/160/200 美元三档、按月切换、六个月到期）与&quot;从价&quot;并置为可选路径，使同一件货的税额可能相差数倍。引擎的正确性从不等于&quot;算出一个数&quot;，而等于<strong>两套方法都能算、都留证、都可在同一冻结输入下复现</strong>。同 hub 相邻主题里，<a href=\"../policy-rule-model/de-minimis-threshold-taxonomy\">低值免税门槛与税种分类</a>界定&quot;门槛与税种&quot;，<a href=\"declared-value-consignment-modeling\">申报价值与 consignment 建模</a>提供本篇所依赖的完税价格与计税单元，<a href=\"../policy-rule-model/effective-dated-policy-rule-engine\">有效期政策规则引擎</a>负责让税率与窗口随版本正确生效——本篇则把这三者组装成一台可交付、可稽核的计征机器。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"关税计算引擎：从价税率、按件定额与邮政渠道过渡期计征","id":"关税计算引擎-从价税率-按件定额与邮政渠道过渡期计征"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从价、从量、混合与择大四种骨架","id":"核心概念-从价-从量-混合与择大四种骨架"},{"level":2,"text":"美国邮政渠道过渡期：按件定额的三档与月度切换","id":"美国邮政渠道过渡期-按件定额的三档与月度切换"},{"level":2,"text":"从价税率的取数链：叠加、归并与汇率锁定","id":"从价税率的取数链-叠加-归并与汇率锁定"},{"level":2,"text":"引擎实现：精度、取整、币种与幂等","id":"引擎实现-精度-取整-币种与幂等"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"申报价值与 consignment 建模：内在价值、拆单边界与加固数据","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/demiminimis-lowvalue-parcel-policy/declaration-duty-engine/declared-value-consignment-modeling"},"next":{"title":"IOSS / 进口增值税征收与一站式申报的系统集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/demiminimis-lowvalue-parcel-policy/declaration-duty-engine/ioss-vat-collection-integration"}}